    "notes": "A six-bay frame, recessed glazing, roof grid and offset parking entrance identify the Visitors Centre. Its fitted limestone apron opens the porticos and joins native parking pavement. Exterior floor and apron grades use ordinary photos and the standard terrain and pavement. The exact railing profile and slopes are approximate. Visitor facilities and interiors sit outside this exterior model."
